lower hepatotoxicity compared\nto methotrexate.\n\nDirect comparative conclusions are limited by differences in trial design,\ncomparators, enrollment sizes, and study durations. Head-to-head trials\nwould be needed to establish definitive comparative efficacy and safety.\n\n================================================================================\nDocument prepared: Summary of Phase III Clinical Trial Results\nSources: Sponsor trial reports (VitaNova Therapeutics, Aethon Pharmaceuticals,\nMeridian Biosciences); FDA Division of Rheumatology Advisory Communication\n================================================================================\n"})
